{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch the Rolling Rice Ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a super simple 3D action game. Fight off the enemies and reclaim the rice ball before it gets eaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you skillfully deflect enemy attacks, you'll enter <strong>Ultra Focus Mode</strong>\u2014time slows down and your speed increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies and catching the rice ball quickly will boost your score. Aim for a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rice ball rolls unpredictably due to physics-based movement\u2014so a bit of luck might be just what you need to catch it! Each stage is short and fast-paced, so you can play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleared stages can be replayed at any time. Try to beat your high score or fastest clear time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve released a video of the boss battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss is hungry, so its health gradually decreases over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to focus solely on dodging or go on the offensive \u2014 either way is fine. Enjoy this unique twist on a boss fight!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868050?t=1754157232","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3868050?t=1754157232","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868050/3078f3f334adb833e98785161420b131cc41cf74/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754157232","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868050/3078f3f334adb833e98785161420b131cc41cf74/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754157232","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch the Rolling Rice Ball!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a super simple 3D action game. Fight off the enemies and reclaim the rice ball before it gets eaten!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you skillfully deflect enemy attacks, you'll enter <strong>Ultra Focus Mode</strong>\u2014time slows down and your speed increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies and catching the rice ball quickly will boost your score. Aim for a high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rice ball rolls unpredictably due to physics-based movement\u2014so a bit of luck might be just what you need to catch it! Each stage is short and fast-paced, so you can play again and again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cleared stages can be replayed at any time. Try to beat your high score or fastest clear time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve released a video of the boss battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss is hungry, so its health gradually decreases over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose to focus solely on dodging or go on the offensive \u2014 either way is fine. Enjoy this unique twist on a boss fight!</p>","developers":["Myorugi"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3868050/a94a898d71fff1a65c305a7246c9487f83c5d9f8/header.jpg?t=1754157232","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3868050/1805563653/